Each of these libraries has its strengths and is suited to different types of scraping tasks. Jsoup is particularly easy to use for simple HTML parsing, while more complex scenarios might require Apache HttpClient or HtmlUnit. For full-featured web scraping, especially with JavaScript rendering, Selenium WebDriver would be the best choice.
